<p>&quot;Every man has two deaths, when he is buried in the ground and the last time someone says his name. In some ways men can be immortal.&quot; - Ernest Hemingway</p>
<p>This entry was inspired by my own fears of not being able to communicate and be heard. To me, the idea that you could be just out of reach of someone hearing you but still be unheard is the most horrific thing possible. Sprinkle in some paralysis themes and add a touch of torturing your loved ones and this will be what comes out. I hope you enjoy it!</p>
