<p>I have taken the advice of VoidLady and have added the line into the ConProcs.</p>
<p>To address the other notes, I had originally had Lynas being able to hear Perl but it became too convoluted and long to just describe why he could hear her but she couldn't hear him. This choice also comes from my own fear of being locked into my own prison just out of reach from the rest of the world. To me, it is more horrifying to be able to yell and make sounds but have no response from the outside world.</p>
<p>I also chose to use only this one example because I wanted to get across that this is happening to everyone that visits their loved ones, but the Foundation is only really calling attention to this one couple because they are getting information from them. To include more examples felt like it would just be the same thing happening to multiple people and wouldn't contribute to the overall storyline.</p>
<p>Thank you for all the feedback and the +1! :)</p>

